		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=352#comment-25</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[David was such as bright light! A consistent presence at Mendocino Camp and in Northern California Sufi events of all kinds, his calm, unfailing good energy was always so welcome to me.
Shaffee]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>David was such as bright light! A consistent presence at Mendocino Camp and in Northern California Sufi events of all kinds, his calm, unfailing good energy was always so welcome to me.<br />
Shaffee</p>
]]></content:encoded>
